@@ -0,0 +1,219 @@
+Feature: Todo list management
+  As a user
+  I want to manage a persistent todo list
+  So that I can track what I need to do
+
+  Background:
+    Given the app is loaded
+
+  Rule: No-todos state
+
+  Scenario: Main and footer are hidden when there are no todos
+    Given there are no todos
+    Then "#main" is not visible
+    And "#footer" is not visible
+
+  Rule: Creating a new todo
+
+  Scenario: A new todo is created by pressing Enter
+    When I type "Buy milk" into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then the todo list contains a todo titled "Buy milk"
+    And the new-todo input is cleared
+
+  Scenario: Whitespace-only input is ignored
+    When I type "   " into the new-todo input
+    And I press Enter
+    Then the todo list is empty
+
+  Scenario: The new-todo input is focused on page load
+    Then the new-todo input has focus
+
+  Rule: Toggle-all
+
+  Scenario: Marking all todos as complete checks every item
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B", "C"
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then all todos have class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Unchecking toggle-all unmarks all todos
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B", "C"
+    And all todos are completed
+    When I click the toggle-all checkbox
+    Then no todos have class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all becomes checked when all individual todos are checked
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B", "C"
+    When I complete the todo "A"
+    And I complete the todo "B"
+    And I complete the todo "C"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is checked
+
+  Scenario: Toggle-all clears when "Clear completed" is clicked
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B", "C"
+    And all todos are completed
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the toggle-all checkbox is not checked
+
+  Rule: Individual todo item
+
+  Scenario: Clicking the checkbox marks a todo as completed
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the toggle for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" has class "completed"
+    And the todo "Buy milk" has its checkbox checked
+
+  Scenario: Double-clicking a label activates editing mode
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I double-click the label for "Buy milk"
+    Then the "Buy milk" todo item has class "editing"
+    And the edit input contains "Buy milk"
+    And the edit input is focused
+
+  Scenario: Removing a todo by clicking the destroy button
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I click the destroy button for "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+
+  Rule: Editing a todo
+
+  Scenario: Saving an edit by pressing Enter
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I start editing "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit value to "Buy oat milk"
+    And I press Enter while editing
+    Then the todo list contains a todo titled "Buy oat milk"
+    And the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+
+  Scenario: Saving an edit by blurring the input
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I start editing "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit value to "Buy oat milk"
+    And I blur the edit input
+    Then the todo list contains a todo titled "Buy oat milk"
+
+  Scenario: An empty edit destroys the todo
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I start editing "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit value to ""
+    And I press Enter while editing
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+
+  Scenario: A whitespace-only edit destroys the todo
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I start editing "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit value to "   "
+    And I press Enter while editing
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is not in the list
+
+  Scenario: Pressing Escape cancels editing
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I start editing "Buy milk"
+    And I change the edit value to "Buy oat milk"
+    And I press Escape while editing
+    Then the todo "Buy milk" is still titled "Buy milk"
+    And the "Buy milk" todo item does not have class "editing"
+
+  Rule: Item counter
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows the number of active items (singular)
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the todo-count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter shows the number of active items (plural)
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B"
+    Then the todo-count shows "2 items left"
+
+  Scenario: Counter updates when a todo is completed
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B"
+    When I complete the todo "A"
+    Then the todo-count shows "1 item left"
+
+  Rule: Clear completed
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed removes all completed todos
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B", "C"
+    And I complete the todo "A"
+    And I complete the todo "B"
+    When I click "Clear completed"
+    Then the todo "A" is not in the list
+    And the todo "B" is not in the list
+    And the todo "C" is in the list
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is hidden when no todos are completed
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the "Clear completed" button is not visible
+
+  Scenario: Clear completed is visible when at least one todo is completed
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the "Clear completed" button is visible
+
+  Rule: LocalStorage persistence
+
+  Scenario: Todos survive a page reload
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B"
+    And I complete the todo "B"
+    When the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo list contains a todo titled "A"
+    And the todo list contains a todo titled "B"
+    And the todo "B" has class "completed"
+
+  Scenario: Editing state is not persisted
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I start editing "Buy milk"
+    And the page is reloaded
+    Then the "Buy milk" todo item does not have class "editing"
+
+  Scenario: Todos are stored under the "todos-vanilla" key
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    Then localStorage key "todos-vanilla" contains a todo with title "Buy milk"
+
+  Scenario: Each todo has id, title, and completed properties
+    Given the todo list has a todo "Buy milk"
+    When I complete the todo "Buy milk"
+    Then the parsed localStorage entry has items with keys "id", "title", and "completed"
+    And the completed todo's "completed" value is true
+
+  Rule: Routing
+
+  Scenario: Default route shows all todos
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B"
+    And I complete the todo "A"
+    When the route is "#/"
+    Then the todo list shows 2 items
+
+  Scenario: Active route shows only active todos
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B"
+    And I complete the todo "A"
+    When the route is "#/active"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And the visible todos are "B"
+
+  Scenario: Completed route shows only completed todos
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B"
+    And I complete the todo "A"
+    When the route is "#/completed"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And the visible todos are "A"
+
+  Scenario: Active filter persists on reload
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B"
+    And I complete the todo "A"
+    When the route is "#/active"
+    And the page is reloaded
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And the visible todos are "B"
+
+  Scenario: Filter link gets "selected" class when active
+    Given the todo list has a todo "A"
+    When the route is "#/active"
+    Then the "Active" filter link has class "selected"
+    And the "All" filter link does not have class "selected"
+
+  Scenario: A todo completed in filtered view is removed from the view
+    Given the todo list has todos: "A", "B"
+    And the route is "#/active"
+    When I complete the todo "A"
+    Then the todo list shows 1 item
+    And the visible todos are "B"
